OL,3,GNEWSAMissing woman died in road
OL,4,Acollision, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose body was found in a car
OL,7,Fin undergrowth after she had been
OL,8,Fmissing for four weeks died as a result
OL,9,Fof a road traffic collision, according
OL,10,Fto a coroner.
OL,12,FTracey Smith, 57, from Stokesley in
OL,13,FNorth Yorkshire, disappeared on 24
OL,14,FJuly, an inquest at Northallerton
OL,15,FCoroner's Court was told.
OL,17,FHer body was found in a black car down
OL,18,Fan embankment by the A172, at its
OL,19,Fjunction with the A19 near Ingleby
OL,20,FArncliffe, on 18 August.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
